  "title": "Kirby Problem 4.52",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let M and N be closed, orientable topological 4-manifolds with $\\pi_{1}(M) \\cong \\pi_{1}(N)a$ good group. Suppose that M and N are simple homotopy equivalent and stably homeomorphic. Is there a simple homotopy equivalence $N \\to M$ that lies in the orbit of Id $:M \\to M$ under the Wall realization action of $L^{s}_{5}(\\mathbb{Z}[\\pi_{1}(M)])$ on the simple structure set of M?",
